# wip583: (1) AUTOSCROLL off: SELECT shows the page (1-16, 17-32 ...) on the 3rd knob for a moment, every skin; (2) the page can never be one with no steps:
# the length goes down (or a change of pattern) = the page falls back to the last one the length has; (3) the ARP page has the PAGE spot on K3 and SELECT turns the pages there too.
wait 300
expect view 7
expect autoscroll 0
turn K1 4 80
expect len0 32
wait 1500
turn SELECT 1
expect spage 1
shot seqpage_select_1732.png
wait 1500
shot seqpage_after_1732.png
# the length goes back to 16 while on page 17-32: the page follows (never an empty page)
turn K1 -4 80
expect len0 16
wait 100
expect spage 0
# 64 steps, last page, then the length drops to 32: the page = the last one that exists
turn K1 8 80
expect len0 64
wait 1500
turn SELECT -1
expect spage 3
shot seqpage_4964.png
wait 1500
turn K1 -4 80
expect len0 32
wait 100
expect spage 1
# the ARP page: the PAGE spot is always on K3, SELECT turns the pages
tap ARP
wait 300
shot arp_page_spot.png
turn SELECT 1
expect spage 0
shot arp_page_spot_2.png
turn SELECT 1
expect spage 1
